        "text": "<thinking> To create the file `summarize_text.py` that calls a hosted LLM to summarize long text, I will use the Amazon Bedrock service, which is a concrete external provider. I will import the necessary SDK and use the specific model identifier to make the provider identifiable in the code. </thinking>\n",
